     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem athis-answers</b></p><a name=\"athis-answers\"> </a><a name=\"hcathis-answers\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>https://fhir.hl7.at/prenudge/appdata/r4/CodeSystem/athis-answers</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">meta-unknown<a name=\"athis-answers-meta-unknown\"> </a></td><td>Weiß nicht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">meta-not-stated<a name=\"athis-answers-meta-not-stated\"> </a></td><td>Keine Angabe</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-yes<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-yes\"> </a></td><td>Ja</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-no<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-no\"> </a></td><td>Nein</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-yes-daily<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-yes-daily\"> </a></td><td>Ja, täglich</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-yes-occasionally<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-yes-occasionally\"> </a></td><td>Ja, gelegentlich</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-no-not-at-all<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-no-not-at-all\"> </a></td><td>Nein, überhaupt nicht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-no-but-formerly<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-no-but-formerly\"> </a></td><td>Nein, aber früher</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-no-never<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-no-never\"> </a></td><td>Nein, noch nie genutzt/konsumiert</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-severely-visually-impaired<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-severely-visually-impaired\"> </a></td><td>Ich bin stark sehbehindert oder kann nicht sehen</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-severely-hearing-impaired<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-severely-hearing-impaired\"> </a></td><td>Ich bin hochgradig schwerhörig oder gehörlos</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-yes-at-least-one<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-yes-at-least-one\"> </a></td><td>Ja, bei mindestens einer Tätigkeit</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-yes-at-least-once<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-yes-at-least-once\"> </a></td><td>Ja, mindestens einmal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-yes-always<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-yes-always\"> </a></td><td>Ja, jedes Mal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-no-not-always<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-no-not-always\"> </a></td><td>Nein, mindestens einmal nicht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">yn-no-need<a name=\"athis-answers-yn-no-need\"> </a></td><td>Kein Bedarf an medizinischer Versorgung</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">health-very-good<a name=\"athis-answers-health-very-good\"> </a></td><td>Sehr gut</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">health-good<a name=\"athis-answers-health-good\"> </a></td><td>Gut</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">health-fair<a name=\"athis-answers-health-fair\"> </a></td><td>Mittelmäßig</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">health-poor<a name=\"athis-answers-health-poor\"> </a></td><td>Schlecht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">health-very-poor<a name=\"athis-answers-health-very-poor\"> </a></td><td>Sehr schlecht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">func-no-difficulty<a name=\"athis-answers-func-no-difficulty\"> </a></td><td>Keine Schwierigkeiten</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">func-some-difficulty<a name=\"athis-answers-func-some-difficulty\"> </a></td><td>Einige Schwierigkeiten</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">func-a-lot-of-difficulty<a name=\"athis-answers-func-a-lot-of-difficulty\"> </a></td><td>Große Schwierigkeiten</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">func-cannot-do-at-all<a name=\"athis-answers-func-cannot-do-at-all\"> </a></td><td>Es ist zu schwierig, ich kann es gar nicht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">f